Package: ploure
Title: Plotting Utilities for Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person('Samuel', 'Morabito', email = 'smorabit82@gmail.com', role = c('aut', 'cre'))
Description: Lightweight plotting functions shared across single-cell projects: embeddings with corner axes, cell
    outlines and zoom-in panels, publication themes and palettes, per-group metric distributions and marker dot
    plots. Every plot draws from a tidy per-cell data frame, fetched from a Seurat object or taken as a plain data
    frame.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
